# Build context shipped to `docker build`.
#
# - The `toolchain` target ignores everything: source is bind-mounted at
#   runtime by ./scripts/docker-build.sh.
# - The `release` target (default, used by CI) needs the source baked in
#   so build_all.sh can run inside the image. Allow src/, scripts/ and
#   the Nimble manifest.
.git
.github
dist
managed_components
*.md
.dockerignore
